%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "16px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Doctor
    participant PC as PrescriptionsController
    participant PS as PrescriptionsService
    participant PR as PrismaService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over D,DB: CREATE PRESCRIPTION

    D->>PC: POST /prescriptions {patientId, items, notes}
    PC->>PS: create(dto, currentUser)
    PS->>PR: patient.findUnique(id: patientId)
    PR->>DB: SELECT FROM "Patient"
    DB-->>PR: Patient
    alt not found
        PS-->>D: 404
    end
    PS->>PR: prescription.create items
    PR->>DB: INSERT prescription + items
    DB-->>PR: done
    PR-->>PS: prescription
    PS-->>D: 201 code RX-

    Note over D,DB: LIST (role-filtered)

    participant Pt as Patient
    participant PtC as PrescriptionsController
    participant PtS as PrescriptionsService

    Pt->>PtC: GET /prescriptions JWT
    PtC->>PtS: findAll pagination currentUser
    alt role=PATIENT
        PtS->>PR: findMany patient.userId=currentUser.id
    alt role=DOCTOR
        PtS->>PR: findMany author.userId=currentUser.id
    alt role=ADMIN
        PtS->>PR: findMany all
    end
    PR->>DB: SELECT LIMIT OFFSET
    DB-->>PR: list
    PR-->>PtS: data
    PtS-->>PtC: data + meta
    PtC-->>Pt: 200 list

    Note over D,DB: CONSUME + AUDIT LOG

    Pt->>PtC: PATCH /prescriptions/:id/consume
    PtC->>PtS: consume id currentUser
    PtS->>PR: findFirst id patient.userId=currentUser.id
    PR->>DB: SELECT WHERE id + patient
    DB-->>PR: prescription
    alt not found
        PtS-->>Pt: 403
    end
    alt already consumed
        PtS-->>Pt: 400
    end
    PtS->>PR: update status=CONSUMED consumedAt=now
    PtS->>PR: auditLog.create
    PR->>DB: UPDATE + INSERT audit
    PtS-->>Pt: 200 consumed

    Note over D,DB: PDF DOWNLOAD

    participant X as Downloader
    participant PC2 as PrescriptionsController
    participant PtS2 as PrescriptionsService
    participant PDF as PdfService

    X->>PC2: GET /prescriptions/:id/pdf
    PC2->>PtS2: findOne id currentUser
    PtS2->>PR: findFirst id
    PR->>DB: SELECT
    DB-->>PR: prescription
    PtS2-->>PC2: prescription
    PC2->>PDF: generatePdf prescription
    PDF->>PDF: load template
    PDF->>PDF: compile data
    PDF->>PDF: puppeteer render
    PDF-->>PC2: StreamableFile PDF
    PC2-->>X: PDF stream